## Exact theorem

The determinant of `M_2` is nonzero at all 48 archived fibers.  The unique
solution agrees coefficient-for-coefficient with the G3FZ source at every
fiber.  UST.G3GM independently proves the same statement at the correctly
evaluated fresh anchor

```text
